{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3026","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3026","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3026\",\"parent_revision\":\"7b217a9c1f9e360380cfb3e7d90767eac69cd38e71bda3ce85394a7c047662c9\",\"root_revision\":\"7b217a9c1f9e360380cfb3e7d90767eac69cd38e71bda3ce85394a7c047662c9\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-19\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nInvoking `/dh:work-backlog-item create ...` (and `/dh:create-backlog-item`, which routes to it) from a worktree-isolated Claude Code session fails before any of the skill's content is shown: \\\"Shell command failed for pattern \\\\\\\"!`...`\\\\\\\": [stderr] (eval):1: permission denied: ../..\\\". The failing line is the skill's own gate-token injection: `!`node \\\"${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}/scripts/get-gate-token.mjs\\\"`` at the top of plugins/development-harness/skills/work-backlog-item/SKILL.md. Reproduced twice in the same session (2026-08-19), identical error both times. Running the same script directly via a normal Bash tool call (not through the skill's bang-exec mechanism) succeeds without issue, so the script itself is not broken \u2014 the failure is specific to how the bang-exec line's path resolves and executes inside a worktree-isolated session's sandbox. Not yet determined whether this is a CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR substitution issue (resolving to a path requiring ../.. traversal) or a worktree-sandbox restriction on relative-path traversal generally. This blocks the entire work-backlog-item skill (not just item creation) for any worktree-isolated session, forcing a workaround that bypasses the skill's own scope.md instructions and duplicate-detection step entirely.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer relying on this plugin**, I want to **work-backlog-item's gate-token bang-exec fails with \\\"permission denied: ../..\\\" in a worktree-isolated session** so that **the tool works correctly and reliably**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Observed twice during PR #3019 (Astral plugin adoption) session, 2026-08-19, in a worktree-isolated Claude Code session\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-19\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"87a85ec106541b6f2825bacdd66cfc66f98f376ea63f5f31074034bfab1a5ec9\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPiOaNw\"}"}